<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ZAIN V5.1</title>
<style>
body{background:#080c14;color:#fff;font-family:Arial;margin:0;padding:10px}
.header{border:2px solid #00ff88;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;text-align:center}
.card{border-radius:16px;padding:14px;margin-top:12px;background:#101a2a;border:1.5px solid #1e3a5a}
.BUY{border-color:#00ff88} .SELL{border-color:#ff3b3b} .NO{border-color:#ff8c00}
.btn{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:none;width:100%;font-weight:900;font-size:16px;margin-top:10px}
.btn-buy{background:#00ff88;color:#000} .btn-sell{background:#ff3b3b;color:#fff} .btn-no{background:#2a2a2a;color:#ff8c00}
.badge{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold}
.badge-buy{background:#00ff88;color:#000} .badge-sell{background:#ff3b3b;color:#fff} .badge-no{background:#ff8c00;color:#000}
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="header"><h2 style="color:#00ff88;margin:0">ZAIN AI PRO MAX V5.1 - BUY + SELL + ANALYTICS</h2></div>

<div class="card BUY">
<h2>EUR/USD REAL 📈 <span class="badge badge-buy">BUY / UP 68%</span></h2>
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#8aa0b8">RSI: 48.2 | Trend: BULLISH | Analysis: Support se bounce, UP ka chance</p>
<button class="btn btn-buy">⬆️ BUY / UP SIGNAL ACTIVE</button>
</div>

<div class="card SELL">
<h2>GBP/USD REAL 📉 <span class="badge badge-sell">SELL / DOWN 74%</span></h2>
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#8aa0b8">RSI: 71.3 | Trend: BEARISH | Analysis: Overbought, resistance se reject, DOWN ka chance</p>
<button class="btn btn-sell">⬇️ SELL / DOWN SIGNAL ACTIVE</button>
</div>

<div class="card NO">
<h2>USD/JPY REAL <span class="badge badge-no">NO TRADE 34%</span></h2>
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#8aa0b8">Reason: Low confidence - Safe Mode ne rok diya</p>
<button class="btn btn-no">⏸️ NO TRADE - WAIT</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
